    - "Os primeiros anos da terceira gera\xE7\xE3o terminaram. Execute todas as a\xE7\xF5es
      de Fim de Rodada."
    - I primi anni della terza generazione sono finiti. Esegui tutte le azioni di
      fine round.
    - "\u7B2C\u4E09\u4EE3\u7684\u65E9\u5E74\u5DF2\u7ECF\u7ED3\u675F\u3002\u6267\u884C\u6240\u6709\u56DE\u5408\u7ED3\u675F\u52A8\u4F5C\u3002"
    - "\u7B2C\u4E09\u4E16\u4EE3\u306E\u521D\u671F\u306F\u7D42\u308F\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306E\u30E9\u30A6\u30F3\u30C9\u7D42\u4E86\u30A2\u30AF\u30B7\u30E7\u30F3\u3092\u5B9F\u884C\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002"
    details2:
    - Then, perform all Start of Round actions for the Middle Years before continuing.
    - "Luego, realiza todas las acciones de Inicio de Ronda para los A\xF1os Intermedios
      antes de continuar."
    - "F\xFChren Sie dann alle Rundenstart-Aktionen f\xFCr die Mittleren Jahre durch,
      bevor Sie fortfahren."
    - "Em seguida, execute todas as a\xE7\xF5es de in\xEDcio de rodada para os anos
      intermedi\xE1rios antes de continuar."
    - Quindi, esegui tutte le azioni di Inizio del Round per gli Anni di Mezzo prima
      di continuare.
    - "\u7136\u540E\uFF0C\u5728\u7EE7\u7EED\u4E4B\u524D\u6267\u884C\u6240\u6709\u4E2D\u5E74\u7684\u201C\u5F00\u59CB\u56DE\u5408\u201D\u52A8\u4F5C\u3002"
    - "\u6B21\u306B\u3001\u7D9A\u884C\u3059\u308B\u524D\u306B\u3001\u4E2D\u5E74\u306E\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306E\u30E9\u30A6\u30F3\u30C9\u958B\u59CB\u30A2\u30AF\u30B7\u30E7\u30F3\u3092\u5B9F\u884C\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002"
    Progress: 7
  - PassageName:
    - NoUni2
    - University2
    - Prosperity2
    - GloomyGothic2
    - Tension2
    - Isolation2
    - Privatized2
    - Liberal2
    - Paradox2
    - MonarchReign2
    - Peace2
    - Warning2
    - Warning2time
    Details:
    - The Middle Years of the Third Generation has ended. Perform all End of Round
      actions.
    - "Los A\xF1os Intermedios de la Tercera Generaci\xF3n han terminado. Realiza
      todas las acciones de Fin de ronda."
    - "Die mittleren Jahre der dritten Generation sind zu Ende. F\xFChre alle Rundenende-Aktionen
      aus."
    - "Os anos intermedi\xE1rios da Terceira Gera\xE7\xE3o terminaram. Execute todas
      as a\xE7\xF5es de Fim de Rodada."
    - Gli anni di mezzo della terza generazione sono finiti. Esegui tutte le azioni
      di fine round.
    - "\u7B2C\u4E09\u4EE3\u7684\u4E2D\u5E74\u5DF2\u7ECF\u7ED3\u675F\u3002\u6267\u884C\u6240\u6709\u56DE\u5408\u7ED3\u675F\u52A8\u4F5C\u3002"
    - "\u7B2C\u4E09\u4E16\u4EE3\u306E\u4E2D\u5E74\u306F\u7D42\u308F\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306E\u30E9\u30A6\u30F3\u30C9\u7D42\u4E86\u30A2\u30AF\u30B7\u30E7\u30F3\u3092\u5B9F\u884C\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002"
    details2:
    - Then, perform all Start of Round actions for the Late Years before continuing.
    - "Luego, realiza todas las acciones de inicio de ronda para los \xFAltimos a\xF1os
      antes de continuar."
    - "F\xFChren Sie dann alle Rundenstart-Aktionen f\xFCr die sp\xE4ten Jahre durch,
      bevor Sie fortfahren."
    - "Em seguida, execute todas as a\xE7\xF5es de In\xEDcio da Rodada para os Anos
      Finais antes de continuar."
    - Quindi, esegui tutte le azioni di inizio round per gli ultimi anni prima di
      continuare.
    - "\u7136\u540E\uFF0C\u5728\u7EE7\u7EED\u4E4B\u524D\u6267\u884C\u665A\u5E74\u7684\u6240\u6709\u201C\u5F00\u59CB\u56DE\u5408\u201D\u52A8\u4F5C\u3002"
    - "\u6B21\u306B\u3001\u7D9A\u884C\u3059\u308B\u524D\u306B\u3001\u6669\u5E74\u306E\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306E\u30E9\u30A6\u30F3\u30C9\u958B\u59CB\u30A2\u30AF\u30B7\u30E7\u30F3\u3092\u5B9F\u884C\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002"
    Progress: 8
  - PassageName:
