    Details:
    - The Late Years of the Third Generation has ended.
    - "Terminaron los a\xF1os intermedios de la tercera generaci\xF3n."
    - Die mittleren Jahre der dritten Generation sind zu Ende.
    - "Os anos intermedi\xE1rios da terceira gera\xE7\xE3o terminaram."
    - Gli anni di mezzo della terza generazione sono finiti.
    - "\u7B2C\u4E09\u4EE3\u7684\u4E2D\u5E74\u5DF2\u7ECF\u7ED3\u675F."
    - "\u7B2C\u4E09\u4E16\u4EE3\u306E\u4E2D\u5E74\u306F\u7D42\u308F\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F."
    details2:
    - Perform any End of Round actions before continuing.
    - "Realice cualquier acci\xF3n de fin de ronda antes de continuar."
    - "F\xFChre eine beliebige Aktion zum Ende der Runde aus, bevor du fortf\xE4hrst."
    - "Execute qualquer a\xE7\xE3o de Fim de Rodada antes de continuar."
    - Esegui qualsiasi azione di fine round prima di continuare.
    - "\u5728\u7EE7\u7EED\u4E4B\u524D\u6267\u884C\u4EFB\u4F55\u56DE\u5408\u7ED3\u675F\u52A8\u4F5C."
    - "\u7D9A\u884C\u3059\u308B\u524D\u306B\u3001\u30E9\u30A6\u30F3\u30C9\u7D42\u4E86\u30A2\u30AF\u30B7\u30E7\u30F3\u3092\u5B9F\u884C\u3057\u307E\u3059."
    Progress: 0
