      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "My Father\u2019s Work is a game of Victorian era mad scientist ambition
    told over three generations. The Storybook App controls the direction of the
    Town depending on the decisions made by the players. It will require that players
    interact with it by clicking on specific passages at certain times."
