--- !u!114 &1797232452
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1797232450}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 73bf010fc49061548b34ed69c5b44146, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  clip: {fileID: 0}
  btnAddPlayer: {fileID: 0}
  continueBtn: {fileID: 2044424987}
  continueBtn2: {fileID: 1677783589}
  playerIntroAnim: {fileID: 1856384922}
  PlayerNameIntro: {fileID: 693381776}
  playerNameTextList:
  - {fileID: 1980545275}
  - {fileID: 725938655}
  - {fileID: 380504324}
  - {fileID: 1076172907}
  - {fileID: 1306485920}
  IntroPanelText: {fileID: 1721700871}
  playerIntroText: {fileID: 2002261852}
  introText1:
  - Our warmest regards.
  - Nos salutations les plus chaleureuses.
  introText2:
  - Please enjoy your experience.
  - Por favor, disfrutar de su experiencia.
  - "Bitte genie\xDFen Sie Ihre Erfahrungen."
  - "Por favor, aproveite a sua experi\xEAncia."
  - Si prega di godere la vostra esperienza.
  - "\u8BF7\u4EAB\u53D7\u4F60\u7684\u7ECF\u9A8C\u3002"
  - "\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306E\u7D4C\u9A13\u3092\u304A\u697D\u3057\u307F\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002"
  introText3:
  - May your name live in infamy.
  - "Que su nombre vivir\xE1 en la infamia."
  - Kann Ihr Name in Infamie lebt.
  - "Que o seu nome viver\xE1 na inf\xE2mia."
  - "Possa il tuo nome vivr\xE0 nell'infamia."
  - "\u613F\u4F60\u7684\u540D\u5B57\u56FD\u803B\u3002"
  - "\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306E\u540D\u524D\u306F\u6C5A\u540D\u306B\u4F4F\u3093\u3067\u3044\u308B\u3053\u3068\u304C\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002"
  introText4:
  - Be sure to leave your mark on the world.
  - "Aseg\xFArese de dejar su huella en el mundo."
  - Seien Sie sicher, dass Ihre Marke auf der Welt zu verlassen.
  - Certifique-se de deixar a sua marca no mundo.
  - Assicurarsi di lasciare il vostro segno nel mondo.
  - "\u4E00\u5B9A\u8981\u5728\u4E16\u754C\u4E0A\u7559\u4E0B\u4F60\u7684\u5370\u8BB0\u3002"
  - "\u4E16\u754C\u306B\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306E\u8DB3\u8DE1\u3092\u6B8B\u3057\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002"
  introText5:
  - Be sure to leave your mark on the world.
  - "Aseg\xFArese de dejar su huella en el mundo."
  - Seien Sie sicher, dass Ihre Marke auf der Welt zu verlassen.
  - Certifique-se de deixar a sua marca no mundo.
  - Assicurarsi di lasciare il vostro segno nel mondo.
  - "\u4E00\u5B9A\u8981\u5728\u4E16\u754C\u4E0A\u7559\u4E0B\u4F60\u7684\u5370\u8BB0\u3002"
  - "\u4E16\u754C\u306B\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306E\u8DB3\u8DE1\u3092\u6B8B\u3057\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002"
  introPanelText1:
  - As siblings of an influential family of Eastern European descent, the
  - "En tant que fr\xE8res et s\u0153urs d'une famille influente d'origine est-europ\xE9enne,
    les"
  introPanelText2:
  - of us have received a not-insignificant portion of our family's estate. Before
    we begin, let us make this historical fiction more engaging by providing our
    names.
  - "d'entre nous ont re\xE7u une part non n\xE9gligeable de la succession de notre
    famille. Avant de commencer, rendons cette fiction historique plus attrayante
    en fournissant nos noms."
  LanguageWiseNumberWord:
  - numbers:
    - two
    - three
    - four
    - five
  - numbers:
    - deux
    - Trois
    - quatre
    - cinq
